Lamalama's vowels do not show contrastive length.{{sfn|Verstraete|2019|p=280}} There are two [[diphthongs]], {{IPA|/ia/}} and {{IPA|/ua/}}.{{sfn|Verstraete|2019|p=281}} {{IPA|/ia/}} can raise to {{IPA|[iɛ]}}, and {{IPA|/ua/}} can raise to {{IPA|[uɔ]}}.{{sfn|Verstraete|2019|p=282}}

